# Samurai: 96x64 cells, 8-wide sheet of 18 rows. idle 0-4, walk 8-15, attack 24-31, hurt 96-99, death 128-136; the many extra slash, thrust and spin rows are left unimported.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet samurai.ppm
cell 96 64

bank SAMURAI
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-4
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 8-15
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 24-31
seq HURT   once ticks=3 : lin 96-99
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 128-136
